# RedFlag Documentation

This directory contains documentation for the RedFlag project, organized by theme.

## Directory Structure

- **brand/** - Brand guidelines and visual identity documentation
  - `BRAND_GUIDELINES.md` - Core brand guidelines, colors, and design specifications

- **development/** - Development-related documentation
  - `DEV_NOTES.md` - Technical notes and references for developers

- **marketing/** - Marketing strategy and execution documents
  - `CONTENT_MARKETING_STRATEGY.md` - Content planning, creation, and distribution strategy
  - `DIGITAL_ADVERTISING_STRATEGY.md` - Detailed digital advertising approach by channel
  - `display_ad_titles.md` - Ad title options for testing
  - `GTM_MARKETING_PLAN.html` - Comprehensive Go-To-Market plan (HTML format)
  - `GTM_STRATEGY_ACTION_PLAN.md` - Detailed GTM strategy with action items
  - `MARKETINGPLAN.md` - Core marketing plan overview
  - `MARKETING_ANALYTICS_FRAMEWORK.md` - KPIs, reporting, and attribution model
  - `MARKETING_CALENDAR_6MONTHS.md` - 6-month marketing activity calendar
  - `MARKETING_PLAN_SUMMARY.html` - Concise marketing plan summary (HTML format)

- **product/** - Product specifications and requirements
  - `prd.md` - Product Requirements Document (PRD)

- **project/** - Project management and planning documents
  - `TODO.md` - Project tasks and to-do items
  - `progress.md` - Project progress tracking

## Document Naming Conventions

- All documentation files use markdown (`.md`) format except for HTML-based presentations
- File names use UPPERCASE for document type/category
- Use underscores (_) to separate words in filenames